        "thread_goal": "Align on promotion scope, target items, and overall objectives.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 186687,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hey team, let's kick off the new Seasonal In-Store Food Promotion Corner project! I've created the sheet for our product list and stock plan, it's A1. What are your first thoughts on products we should feature?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "wave",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 433060,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Great! I was thinking we could do a 'build your own charcuterie board' theme. We could feature some local cheeses, cured meats, and maybe some nice crackers and fruit preserves. It's a popular concept.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "cheese_wedge",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 439564,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "I like that idea. It's simple and feels premium. We could also add some pre-packaged olives and artisanal nuts to round it out.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 128528,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "The charcuterie idea is strong, but we need to be very careful with cured meats regarding food safety regulations. They require specific handling and storage. Before we add them to A1, we should confirm the exact requirements with the food safety officer.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 311830,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "That's a critical point, @128528. Let's proceed with that check in mind. For now, let's agree on the core product categories. How does this sound for a start: 1. Local Cheeses, 2. Specialty Crackers/Breads, 3. Jams & Preserves, 4. Olives & Nuts. We can add 'Cured Meats' as a fifth category, pending the safety compliance check.",
            "mentions": [
              128528
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 186687,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Perfect, that's a clear list. I'll structure A1 with these categories. This brings up our objectives. Are we aiming purely for a sales lift, or is customer experience and introducing new products also a key goal?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 439564,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "I think it should be both. Good experience drives future sales.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "handshake",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 311830,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Agreed. Let's formalize that. Objective 1: Increase sales in the featured categories by 15%. Objective 2: Improve customer engagement by offering a curated, high-quality selection. Does everyone agree with these goals?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 186687,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Yes, clear and measurable. I'm good with that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 433060,
