            "msg_id": "M65",
            "speaker_id": 186687,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, end-of-week-1 report! As promised, I've updated the sales tracker A6. The good news: the local cheddar and fig jam are huge hits. The not-so-good: the salami isn't moving at all. We've also had a couple of customers mention they had trouble finding the prices.",
