          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 128528,
            "reply_to": "M66",
            "text": "A bundle is an option, but it might be simpler to just replace it. I spoke with our cheese supplier yesterday, and they have a new smoked gouda available that could be a big seller. Less risk than trying to push an unpopular item.",
